    <string name="about_body">I-BenSuet Stay isiza abafundi baseNingizimu Afrika ukuthola indawo yokuhlala ephephile neqinisekisiwe eduze kwekhampasi yabo, nezindawo ze-NSFAS nezokuzixhasa endaweni eyodwa. Yakhiwe yi-Mansuet Dev.</string>
