    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Susa i-akhawunti yakho?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Lokhu kususa unomphela iphrofayela yakho ye-BenSuet Stay nokungena kwakho. Lokhu akunakuhlehliswa.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">I-akhawunti yakho isusiwe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">I-BenSuet Stay iqoqa kuphela lokho okudingekayo ukuxhumanisa abafundi nezindawo zokuhlala.\n\nEsikuqoqayo: igama lakho, i-imeyili, ikheli lasekhaya, isikhungo nohlobo loxhaso. Uma ufaka isicelo sekamelo sigcina nenombolo yakho kamazisi ye-SA, inombolo yomfundi, ikhampasi, imininingwane yesihlobo esiseduze namagama amadokhumenti owakhethile. Kubanikazi bezindawo: igama, i-imeyili nenombolo yocingo.\n\nKungani: ukukhombisa izindawo ezifanele, ukuvumela abanikazi bezindawo ukuthi baphathe ukubuka nezicelo zakho, nokukuthumelela izibuyekezo ngakho.\n\nUbani ongakubona: wena kuphela, umnikazi wendawo oxhumana nayo, nabaphathi be-BenSuet Stay. Imithetho yokuphepha yesizindalwazi sethu iqinisekisa lokhu.\n\nLapho kugcinwa khona: i-Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, isifunda saseGoli). Amaphasiwedi aphathwa yi-Firebase Authentication futhi awagcinwa neze wuhlelo.\n\nAmalungelo akho ngaphansi kwe-POPIA: ungabuka futhi ubuyekeze imininingwane yakho ku-Izilungiselelo, futhi ususe i-akhawunti yakho noma nini ku-Izilungiselelo → Ubumfihlo → Susa i-akhawunti yami. Kokunye, sebenzisa Izilungiselelo → Usizo → Xhumana nosizo.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ngibhuka kanjani ukubuka indawo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Vula isikhangiso bese uthepha u-Bhukela ukubuka, bese ukhetha usuku nesikhathi. Umnikazi wendawo uyakuqinisekisa noma akwenqabe, futhi uthola isaziso kunoma ikuphi.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ngifaka kanjani isicelo sekamelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Vula isikhangiso, khetha uhlobo lwekamelo bese uthepha u-Khetha ikamelo. Abafundi be-NSFAS baqinisekisa imininingwane yabo ye-NSFAS; abazixhasayo bengeza imininingwane yesihlobo esiseduze namadokhumenti abo. Kulandelele ku-Izilungiselelo → Izicelo zami.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">Ngingalusebenzisa uhlelo ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Yebo. Izikhangiso osuke uzivulile zihlala zibonakala, futhi izicelo zokubuka noma izicelo ozenze ungaxhunyiwe zigcinwa efonini yakho bese zithunyelwa ngokuzenzakalelayo uma uphinde uxhumeke.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Kungani ngingaboni zonke izindawo zokuhlala?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Ikhasi lasekhaya liqala nohlobo lwakho loxhaso futhi u-Eduze kwekhampasi yami kuvuliwe. Thepha u-Konke noma u-Eduze kwekhampasi yami ukuze unwebe ukusesha, noma ushintshe lokhu ku-Izilungiselelo → Isikrini sasekhaya.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ubani odala futhi ohlela izikhangiso zami?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Ithimba labaphathi be-BenSuet Stay lidala izikhangiso bese likunikeza zona. Ukuze ushintshe isikhangiso noma imininingwane yakho, sebenzisa u-Xhumana nosizo, noma u-Cela ushintsho ku-Imininingwane yomuntu siqu.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ngiziphatha kanjani izicelo zokubuka?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Vula u-Ukubhuka bese uqinisekisa noma wenqaba isicelo ngasinye. Uma wenqaba, nikeza isizathu futhi uphakamise esinye isikhathi. Umfundi uyaziswa ngokushesha.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Kwenzekani uma ngivuma isicelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Isikhala esisodwa sisuswa kulolo hlobo lwekamelo ngokuzenzakalelayo, futhi umfundi ubona inothi lakho ku-Izicelo zami.</string>
</resources>
